Ciao! I see you're ready to dive into the deep end. I've consulted the "most frequent" words, and while Wikipedia is... interesting, it seems to have a bit of a temper today.

Don't worry, I've filtered out the "spicy" suggestions from that list to keep you from getting kicked out of a café on your first day. We are going to focus on the essentials: greetings, politeness, and the building blocks of a real conversation.

Since you already know sì, no, and chi, let's expand your toolkit so you can actually talk to people (and not just interrogate them).

